    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="d2/d36/enumorg_1_1xvm_1_1compiler_1_1ast_1_1_type_composition_statement_1_1_zone" kindref="compound">Zone</ref> enumeration defines the zone within which a particular type is declared. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para><bold><javadoccode>TopLevel</javadoccode></bold> - the module itself, or declared within a module or package; </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para><bold><javadoccode>InClass</javadoccode></bold> - declared within a class, e.g. an inner class; </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para><bold><javadoccode>InMethod</javadoccode></bold> - declared within the body of a method. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para><bold><javadoccode>InProperty</javadoccode></bold> - declared within the body of a property. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
